WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:03,220
They forced me to trade my body for that antipyretic pill.

2
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:04,660
They take turns bullying me

3
00:00:04,660 --> 00:00:06,180
If you don’t believe me, kill me

4
00:00:06,180 --> 00:00:18,530
There's almost no food at home

5
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:20,530
If we don't find a way, all three of us will starve to death.

6
00:00:20,530 --> 00:00:22,130
It’s the university and it’s hail outside

7
00:00:22,130 --> 00:00:24,210
Aren't you looking for death if you go out? What should I do?

8
00:00:24,210 --> 00:00:25,410
You can't go hungry, right?

9
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:28,830
Those two women on the fifteenth floor

10
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,430
Go out every two days to look for supplies.

11
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:31,710
My family must have invested a lot

12
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:32,910
But they have guns

13
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,270
So what if you have a gun?

14
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:35,630
It’s been so long since the end

15
00:00:35,630 --> 00:00:37,230
Who knows how many bullets are left?

16
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:40,160
The woman who moved me

17
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,980
Just in time for you two to try her gun first.

18
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:48,900
This Mid-Autumn Festival, we won’t be able to admire the moon.

19
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,820
But I can live peacefully

20
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,260
What else is there to be dissatisfied with?
